# Values packed as `any ^Num` and counted (Type System ch. 3: `any ^Trait` packs a value
# with its dictionary; ruling EX: what cannot be done with a packed value is calling a
# method that needs one dictionary for two values, a checker error at the call, so the
# packing itself is legal). Written by Claude on the claude-lowering branch; subject to
# change.
emit Ui.*
test mod Tests
use Ui.*

Zeros: fn [any ^Num] -> Nat
fn Zeros vs = Len vs

@page: @unit
@page:
    Ui.Label($text=$"{Zeros [[any 21, any 2.5]]} numbers")
